OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCold
OL,6,Fand bright to start but turning
OL,7,Funsettled as rain later Monday brings
OL,8,Fa risk of snow on higher ground.
OL,9,FSpells of rain persisting Tuesday and
OL,10,FWednesday. Remaining generally cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
